From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:51:15 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 55/97] power: supply: add S2MPU06 charger and fuel gauge
 drivers

Both sit on the PMIC's SPEEDY bus and are cells of the PMIC core. The charger
IC runs the charging cycle on its own: the driver reports its state, exposes
the limits and keeps its watchdog fed. The fuel gauge only reads the gauge's
result registers; the battery is described by a simple-battery node.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8bd1b56e67b586b8e8e7488a6477acc2ca0b2755)
